    "System: Tu es un agent spécialisé dans la loterie de mail.\n\nTu doit analyser le mail suivant...\nSubject:Google Launches Mangle: A New Language That Could Change How We Work With Databases | Usman Writes\nMessage:Mathieu Gros Stories for Mathieu Gros @mathieu.gros·Become a member Medium daily digest Today's highlights Usman Writes Usman Writes Google Launches Mangle: A New Language That Could Change How We\n\n\nPuis tu rédige une justification courte :\nreplyReason\nPuis tu indique si une réponse est nécessaire :\nneedsReply\nPuis tu indique l'ID du mail :\n19c5ff4c354df080\n\nTa sortie doit absolument respecter Output Paraser \nHuman: Subject:Google Launches Mangle: A New Language That Could Change How We Work With Databases | Usman Writes\nMessage:Mathieu Gros Stories for Mathieu Gros @mathieu.gros·Become a member Medium daily digest Today's highlights Usman Writes Usman Writes Google Launches Mangle: A New Language That Could Change How We\n\nYou must format your output as a JSON value that adheres to a given \"JSON Schema\" instance.\n\n\"JSON Schema\" is a declarative language that allows you to annotate and validate JSON documents.\n\nFor example, the example \"JSON Schema\" instance {{\"properties\": {{\"foo\": {{\"description\": \"a list of test words\", \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {{\"type\": \"string\"}}}}}}, \"required\": [\"foo\"]}}}}\nwould match an object with one required property, \"foo\". The \"type\" property specifies \"foo\" must be an \"array\", and the \"description\" property semantically describes it as \"a list of test words\". The items within \"foo\" must be strings.\nThus, the object {{\"foo\": [\"bar\", \"baz\"]}} is a well-formatted instance of this example \"JSON Schema\". The object {{\"properties\": {{\"foo\": [\"bar\", \"baz\"]}}}} is not well-formatted.\n\nYour output will be parsed and type-checked according to the provided schema instance, so make sure all fields in your output match the schema exactly and there are no trailing commas!\n\nHere is the JSON Schema instance your output must adhere to. Include the enclosing markdown codeblock:\n```json\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"__structured__output\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"__structured__output__object\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"needsReply\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"replyReason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Explanation of why a reply is needed or not\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"needsReply\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"__structured__output__array\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/properties/__structured__output/properties/__structured__output__object\"}}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Wrapper around the output data. It can only contain __structured__output__object or __structured__output__array but never both.\"}},\"required\":[\"__structured__output\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\"}\n```\n",
